    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "The predicted GRITSS orbit will be delivered to the SLR stations to allow the stations to track the GRITSS satellite. The GRITSS orbit is generated in GEODYN from the on-board navigation solution provided by the Mission Operations Center (MOC) and is provided in the Consolidated Prediction Format (CPF) as defined by the CDDIS. The file is generated daily between Monday-Friday and is created for a 5-day timespan. The 5-day file provides coverage through the weekends/Monday holidays or in the case of any issues with generating the files daily.",
